{"id":"vod_sn_37934","vodId":"37934","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"这就是僵尸吗？第一季","name_cn":"这就是僵尸吗？第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ec266c84a142c9e4e0a451bf502167c4.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《这样算是僵尸吗？》改编自日本小说家木村心一著作，小舞一和梦璃凛插画的同名轻小说，由动画公司Studio DEEN负责制作，于2011年1月10日开放播放，电视动画全12话，另有第13话以OAD的形式随小说单行本第8卷DVD限定版于2011年6月10日发售。故事的男主人公相川步因为被卷入了一起杀人事件而被杀，最后更以僵尸的身份复活了。虽然步得到不死之身，但却不断被卷入各种阴谋与战斗之中，作为代价，步的后宫生活也同时展开，除了缺少表情的死灵法师优，还有旁若无人的魔装少女春奈、做菜是杀人级别的吸血忍者瑟拉及元气的未婚妻友纪等后宫成员。当然还少不了看了会“喷血”的伪魔法少女。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8cjNQGQ3QC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dgN6UHzSjD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9syYmbXxHC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/n8KX1sCEFq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aYfSvUAvKN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PTXNU735fS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AArP2NR8sD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d1BQt8Jp4F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4jnvb2KrRA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U6SE4SKg7R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QZzFXfbTLU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HWqyrSEhHK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/169pY9vn9P1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:04.751Z"}